<section class="page-hero shell compact"><span class="kicker">MERCADO DE OCASIÓN</span><h1>Otra vida para <em>cada coche.</em></h1><p>Publica un anuncio de demostración o explora coches anunciados por otros usuarios.</p></section><section class="section shell"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="kicker">EXPLORAR</span><h2>Anuncios activos.</h2></div><p>Listado de muestra, sin transacciones ni contacto público entre usuarios.</p></div><?php if (!$listings): ?><div class="empty-state surface"><strong>Todavía no hay anuncios.</strong><p>Los coches publicados aparecerán aquí.</p></div><?php else: ?><div class="listing-grid"><?php foreach ($listings as $listing): ?><article class="listing-card"><div class="listing-art"><span>ELIGECOCHE <span class="brand-accent">/ MERCADO</span></span><span class="listing-art-car" aria-hidden="true">▰</span></div><div class="listing-content"><span class="card-overline">OCASIÓN #<?= (int) $listing['id'] ?></span><h3><?= e($listing['make']) ?> <?= e($listing['model']) ?></h3><div class="listing-facts"><span><?= number_format((int) $listing['mileage'], 0, ',', '.') ?> km</span><span><?= date_es($listing['created_at']) ?></span></div><p><?= e($listing['description']) ?></p><strong class="listing-price"><?= money($listing['price']) ?></strong></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></section><section class="section shell two-col"><div class="surface"><span class="card-overline">PUBLICA TU COCHE</span><h2>Crear anuncio</h2><?php if (!current_user()): ?><p class="muted">Accede con tu cuenta de cliente para publicar un anuncio.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/acceder">Iniciar sesión ↗</a><?php elseif (current_user()['role'] !== 'customer'): ?><p class="muted">La publicación está disponible para cuentas de cliente.</p><?php else: ?><form action="/mercado" method="post" class="stack-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="form-grid"><label>Marca<input type="text" name="make" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Ej. Audi"></label><label>Modelo<input type="text" name="model" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Ej. A3"></label></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Kilometraje<input type="number" name="mileage" min="1" max="2000000" required placeholder="45000"></label><label>Precio (€)<input type="number" name="price" min="1" max="9999999" step="0.01" required placeholder="12500"></label></div><label>Descripción<textarea name="description" minlength="10" maxlength="3000" rows="5" required placeholder="Características, estado, extras..."></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Publicar anuncio ↗</button></form><?php endif; ?></div><div class="surface"><span class="card-overline">ÁREA PERSONAL</span><h2>Mis anuncios</h2><?php if (!current_user() || current_user()['role'] !== 'customer'): ?><p class="muted">Inicia sesión para administrar tus anuncios.</p><?php elseif (!$mine): ?><p class="muted">Aún no tienes anuncios publicados.</p><?php else: ?><div class="my-listings"><?php foreach ($mine as $listing): ?><div class="my-listing"><div><strong><?= e($listing['make']) ?> <?= e($listing['model']) ?></strong><small><?= $listing['is_active'] ? 'Activo' : 'Retirado' ?> · <?= money($listing['price']) ?></small></div><?php if ($listing['is_active']): ?><form method="post" action="/mercado/<?= (int) $listing['id'] ?>/retirar"><?= csrf_field() ?><button type="submit" class="btn-link">Retirar</button></form><?php endif; ?></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></div></section>